		<div class="page-bulletins background--astral text--white">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="col-wrap">
            <div class="col">
                <div class="col margin-left--0">
                    <h1 class="padding-bottom--0 padding-top--0 margin-top--2 font-weight-700 margin-bottom--2 ">Retail sales, Great Britain: June 2026</h1>
                    <p class="page-bulletins--Summary margin-right-md--2 margin-bottom--3 padding-bottom--0 padding-top--0">
                    
                        
                            Retail sales rose in the three months to June 2026, according to our first estimate. 
                        
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div> 
        </div> 
    </div> 
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="col-wrap">
            

    
    
